    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      580.33,
      539.86,
      617.44
    ],
    "text": "The notification relating to the Rates of Exchange published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2119/2 of 15th April, 2019is hereby rescinded and the said Rates of Exchange are Scheduled to be rescinded by a similar notification to be publishedon or before 28th April, 2019.",
